    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "## Claim\n\nOutput-level benchmarks reward correct answers from broken processes the same as sound ones (Gettier applied to agents). Provenance makes reliabilist evaluation operational.\n\n## Process questions unlocked\n\n- **Skill contribution** \u2014 which skills correlate with correct outcomes vs contextslop\n- **Mechanism reliability** \u2014 inference vs retrieval-and-paraphrase vs guessing\n- **Failure localization** \u2014 which operation/skill introduced the error\n- **Counterfactual replay** \u2014 re-run the log with one skill removed\n\nThese are queries against a provenance graph, not new metric inventions.",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-16T20:32:38.861Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-16T20:32:38.861Z"
    }
